---
description: Default styling conventions for this project
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user asks to use the "default stylesheet" or "default style":

- Treat `src/styles/default.css` as the canonical style reference.
- Inspect that file before creating new UI.
- Reuse its existing variables, spacing, typography, colors, border radii, and component patterns.
- Prefer existing classes and patterns over inventing new ones.
- Do not introduce a new design system unless explicitly asked.